# Python environment

Root cause: Ubuntu/Debian Python is externally managed (PEP 668); `pip install` to system fails.

Always use `/home/ubuntu/aider-exp/.venv` (`python3 -m venv .venv`). Run tools via `.venv/bin/python` / `.venv/bin/pytest` / `.venv/bin/agent-run`.
